                        "sense_id": "9463bbb5-5018-3e72-9f0b-1aee5b57f59c",
                        "entry_id": "f72eb09c-8f29-35db-9ebe-541843050a74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Constructed from turf."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "27366c32-1b50-431e-afee-dac49bf97b86",
                                "sense_id": "9463bbb5-5018-3e72-9f0b-1aee5b57f59c",
                                "text": "The space of ground taken up by a rich man's house is prodigious, the turfed roof forming a small field."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1d9be94-c732-4d9c-b8aa-892ca3e18ff4",
                                "sense_id": "9463bbb5-5018-3e72-9f0b-1aee5b57f59c",
                                "text": "Viðimyri church is almost the only specimen remaining of a turf church. It looks outside very like a neatly turfed cottage, with the ornament of crossed planks with carved ends on its wooden front gable."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "65342367-7d99-3197-b144-93ebb58ea58e",
                        "entry_id": "f72eb09c-8f29-35db-9ebe-541843050a74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Covered or adorned with turf or grass."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cdde4641-9739-4c6b-beed-c3a6456a4773",
                                "sense_id": "65342367-7d99-3197-b144-93ebb58ea58e",
                                "text": "For aviaries, I like them not, except they be of that largeness as they may be turfed, and have living plants and bushes set in them; that the birds may have more scope, and natural nestling, and that no foulness appear in the floor of the aviary."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17cea9e7-56cd-4128-b1c7-b1195501a4dc",
                                "sense_id": "65342367-7d99-3197-b144-93ebb58ea58e",
                                "text": "3. The course should use a minimal amount of fairway area, rather than being completely turfed from tee box to green."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
